# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for research.hecs_r0_mechanics in the TSan build (see CMakeLists.txt).
# The Rust test process is not instrumented: libtest's result channel (std::sync::mpmc) synchronizes through
# atomics TSan cannot observe, so its hand-off of a completed test is reported as a race. Only that channel is
# suppressed; K1 itself is instrumented, and the tests still create and drive K1 states on parallel threads.
race:*sync*mpmc*
